From 97524f6713101a85e078b762c438e133c14aebd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henry Wang <henwang@amazon.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Nov 2025 21:47:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Switch containerd image backend's image pull to transfer
 service.

This patch is based on the open upstream PR: https://github.com/moby/moby/pull/49820.

Progress reporting is unimplemented because it's not a requirement for BR use case.

Signed-off-by: Henry Wang <henwang@amazon.com>
[bcressey: enable hosts.toml support]
Signed-off-by: Ben Cressey <bcressey@amazon.com>
[Rebased for Docker 29.9.0: use the current Moby registry package and
regenerate vendor additions from containerd v2.4.1. Preserve image bookkeeping
and content completeness, validate unpacking, and retain the upstream pull
path for bearer tokens unsupported by the transfer resolver. Add focused
credential and error regression tests.]
